	pq:P6607 "describe the track as its general type, e.g. vocal track (Q55850593) or  instrumental track (Q55850643), and add cover version as a characteristic (P1552)"@en,
		"描述该音轨的总体类型，例如人声音轨 (Q55850593) 或器乐音轨 (Q55850643)，并将翻唱版本添加为一项特征 (P1552)。"@zh ;
	pq:P6104 wd:Q5830855 .

wd:P31 p:P2302 wds:P31-7760137c-48b6-4957-bb4e-d48f27e377ad .

