	ps:P2302 wd:Q52558054 ;
	pq:P2305 wd:Q590490 ;
	pq:P6607 "Items typically do not represent names for a particular entity, but represent the named entity itself, such as a person or place. Names may be represented with lexemes. If a Q-item really represents a name of one of these types, it can be added as an exception to this constraint."@en,
		"项目通常不代表特定实体的名称，而是代表实体本身，例如人或地点。名称可以用词素表示。如果某个Q项确实代表这些类型之一的名称，则可以将其作为例外添加到此约束条件中。"@zh .

