		"that class of which this subject is a particular example and member; different from P279 (subclass of); for example: K2 is an instance of mountain; volcano is a subclass of mountain (and an instance of volcanic landform)"@en-gb,
		"chit-ê mi̍h-kiāⁿ sī kî-tiong te̍k-tēng ê hoān-lē kah sêng-oân ê lūi-pia̍t: kah téng-koân hun-lūi(P279) bô-kâng; pí-jū-kóng, Hù-sū-san sī chi̍t-ê soaⁿ, hóe-soaⁿ téng-koân hun-lūi sī soaⁿ (mā sī chi̍t-ê hóe-soaⁿ tē-hêng)"@nan,
		"這个物件是其中特定的範例佮成員的類別：佮頂懸分類(P279) 無仝;比喻講，富士山是一个山，火山頂懸分類是山 (嘛是一个火山地形)"@nan-hani,
		"這个物件是其中特定的範例佮成員的類別：佮頂懸分類(P279) 無仝;比喻講，富士山是一个山，火山頂懸分類是山 (嘛是一个火山地形)"@nan-hant,
		"chit-ê mi̍h-kiāⁿ sī kî-tiong te̍k-tēng ê hoān-lē kah sêng-oân ê lūi-pia̍t: kah téng-koân hun-lūi(P279) bô-kâng; pí-jū-kóng, Hù-sū-san sī chi̍t-ê soaⁿ, hóe-soaⁿ téng-koân hun-lūi sī soaⁿ (mā sī chi̍t-ê hóe-soaⁿ tē-hêng)"@nan-latn-pehoeji,
